# bot-ya BYOK — only the variable relevant to this excerpt is listed.
# See bot-ya main repo for the full env spec.

# Symmetric key used for AES-256-CBC encryption of user-provided BYOK API keys.
# - Hashed with SHA-256 to derive a 32-byte AES key (see src/utils/crypto.js).
# - Any non-empty string works, but use a high-entropy value in production.
# - Changing this key after BYOK activation will break decryption of existing stored keys.
ENCRYPTION_KEY=
